"Drupal core does not immediately delete temporary file. For webform "
"submissions it is recommended that temporary files are immediately "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Drupalovo jedro začasnih datotek takoj ne izbriše. Pri oddaji "
"obrazcev Webform je priporočljivo, da se začasne datoteke takoj "
"izbriše."

