"Upload files will include the file's id, name, uri, and data (<a "
"href=\":href\">Base64</a> encode)."
msgstr ""
"Prenosi datotek bodo vključevali id datoteke, ime, uri in podatke "
"(kodirano z <a href=\":href\">Base64</a>)."

