msgid ""
"Provides a workaround for the common problem that users with 'Use the "
"administration pages and help' permission see menu links they don't "
"have access permission for. Deprecated from Drupal 10.3 and above."
msgstr ""
"Ponuja obvod za pogost problem, pri katerem uporabniki z dovoljenjem "
"»Uporabi skrbniške strani in pomoč« vidijo povezave v meniju, do "
"katerih nimajo dostopa z dovoljenjem. Od Drupala 10.3 naprej je to "
"zastarelo."

