msgstr "Ponudnik delovnega prostora."

msgid ""
"An intentionally plain theme to demonstrate and test default HTML and "
"CSS. Stark should not be used as a base theme. Instead, build a custom "
"theme using the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/develop/theming-drupal\">Theming "
"Guide</a> as a reference."
msgstr ""
"Namerno preprosta tema za prikaz in preizkus privzetega HTML-ja in "
"CSS-a. Temnejša (Stark) ne bi smela biti uporabljena kot osnovna "
"tema. Namesto tega zgradite svojo prilagojeno temo z uporabo <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/develop/theming-drupal\">Vodnika za "
"tematizacijo (Theming Guide)</a> kot reference."

msgid "Local files stored under a module's directory."
msgstr "Lokalne datoteke, shranjene v imeniku modula."

