msgstr "Dovoli HTML v oznaki: @label_as_html"

msgid "Extra CSS classes: @classes"
msgstr "Dodatni CSS-razredi: @classes"

msgid ""
"Allows using (XSS-filtered) HTML in the label (e.g. icons). Note, that "
"some elements might not have labels by default, but that can differ "
"per theme."
msgstr ""
"Omogoča uporabo (z XSS-filtriranim) HTML-ja v oznaki (npr. ikon). "
"Upoštevajte, da nekateri elementi privzeto morda nimajo oznak, vendar "
"je to lahko odvisno od teme."

