msgstr "Nastavitve vrste entitete"

msgid "On every cron run"
msgstr "Ob vsakem zagonu cron-a"

msgid "Submission interval"
msgstr "Interval oddaje"

msgid ""
"The frequency with which entities of this type change. Search engine "
"bots may take this as an indication of how often to index them."
msgstr ""
"Kako pogosto se entitete te vrste spremenijo. Spletni iskalniki lahko "
"to vzamejo kot pokazatelj, kako pogosto jih naj indeksirajo."

msgid ""
"Determines if images referenced by entities of this type should be "
"included in the sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Določa, ali naj se slike, na katere se sklicujejo entitete te vrste, "
"vključijo v zemljevid spletnega mesta (sitemap)."

