msgstr "Uredite nastavitve Simple XML Sitemap na obrazcih entitet."

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting entity forms. Changes include creating, deleting and "
"updating of an entity.<br/>This behavior can be overridden on entity "
"forms. Don't forget to <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">include "
"entities</a>."
msgstr ""
"Po oddaji obrazcev entitet takoj pošiljajte obvestilo o spremembah "
"iskalnikom, ki so združljivi z IndexNow. Spremembe vključujejo "
"ustvarjanje, brisanje in posodabljanje entitet.<br/>To obnašanje je "
"mogoče preglasiti na obrazcih entitet. Ne pozabite na <a "
"href=\"@inclusion_url\">vključitev entitet</a>."

