"Pages and cards cannot be used in the same webform. Please remove or "
"convert the pages/cards to the same element type."
msgstr ""
"Strani in kartice ni mogoče uporabljati v istem spletnem obrazcu. "
"Odstranite jih ali pa strani/kartice pretvorite v isti tip elementa."

